                <h3 class="h5">Choose a Service</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Browse categories and tell us what you need — plumbing, electrical, cleaning, and more.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="public-step">
                <div class="public-step-num">2</div>
                <h3 class="h5">Get Matched</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">We connect you with available, verified providers near your location.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="public-step">
                <div class="public-step-num">3</div>
                <h3 class="h5">Book & Relax</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Confirm your booking, track progress, pay securely, and rate your experience.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="public-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="public-section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p class="public-section-subtitle">Quick answers about booking home services with Sahulat Ghar Tak.</p>
        <div class="public-faq-list">
            <div class="public-faq-item">
                <h3 class="h5">What home services does Sahulat Ghar Tak offer?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Sahulat Ghar Tak connects you with verified electricians, plumbers, cleaners, AC technicians, carpenters, and painters across Pakistan, covering 18+ service categories in total.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="public-faq-item">
                <h3 class="h5">How do I book a plumber or electrician near me?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Choose a service category, tell us what you need, and we match you with an available, verified provider near your location — then confirm and track your booking in the app.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="public-faq-item">
                <h3 class="h5">Are Sahulat Ghar Tak providers verified?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Yes. Every provider is background-checked and profiled with documentation, ratings, and reviews from real customers before they can accept bookings.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="public-faq-item">
                <h3 class="h5">What areas does Sahulat Ghar Tak serve?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Sahulat Ghar Tak operates across Pakistan, with verified home service providers available in Bahria Town and other served areas.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="public-faq-item">
                <h3 class="h5">Is pricing transparent?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Yes. You receive transparent pricing and quotes before confirming a booking, with no hidden charges.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="public-faq-item">
                <h3 class="h5">How do I download the Sahulat Ghar Tak app?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">The Android app is available now on Google Play, with an iOS version coming soon. Visit our <a href="/Home/DownloadApp">Download App</a> page for links and a QR code.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

